WEBVTT

00:04:59.078 --> 00:05:02.903
The horrifying part
was all of the tattoos that I saw

00:05:02.927 --> 00:05:04.782
of images of the Tree of 40 Fruit.

00:05:04.806 --> 00:05:05.829
(Laughter)

00:05:05.853 --> 00:05:08.480
Which I was like, "Why would
you do that to your body?"

00:05:08.504 --> 00:05:09.599
(Laughter)

00:05:09.623 --> 00:05:12.764
And the humbling part
was all of the requests that I received

00:05:12.788 --> 00:05:15.719
from pastors, from rabbis and priests

00:05:15.743 --> 00:05:18.902
who asked to use the tree
as a central part within their service.

00:05:18.926 --> 00:05:20.569
And then it became a meme --

00:05:20.593 --> 00:05:24.212
and the answer to that question
is "I hope not?"

00:05:24.236 --> 00:05:26.450
[Is your marriage
like the Tree of 40 Fruit?]

00:05:26.474 --> 00:05:27.625
(Laughter)

00:05:27.649 --> 00:05:28.937
Like all good memes,

00:05:28.961 --> 00:05:32.437
this has led to an interview
on NPR's "Weekend Edition,"